  "2026-08-21T15:42:09.786Z","harness:codex","Reproduction evidence 2026-08-21: exact-main manual Nightly run 32497483748 reproduced Windows Node 24 only. 65 search-command tests fail because the suite hard-codes D:\\tmp\\pm-search without initializing a tracker after fail-closed tracker preflight; context-integrity-primitives also timed out at 30s. Linux Node 22/24/25 and macOS Node 24 passed. Proceeding with harness-only repair; product preflight remains unchanged."
  "2026-08-21T15:44:24.766Z","harness:codex","TDD green step: focused Linux verification passes 2 files / 98 tests. The red evidence is exact Windows Nightly runs 32447807398 and 32497483748; the fix resolves fixture roots with path.resolve in both suites and raises only the real git-composition test budget to 60s."
  "2026-08-21T15:54:29.116Z","harness:codex","Local pre-review evidence 2026-08-21: focused verification passes 2 files / 98 tests; full repository coverage passes 547 files / 7,681 tests at exactly 100% statements (56,179/56,179), branches (41,937/41,937), functions (11,686/11,686), and lines (54,177/54,177); pnpm quality:static passes all mandatory gates. pm-changelog 2026.8.17 reports CHANGELOG.md unchanged while the item remains in progress. Hosted Windows exact-head evidence remains required before closure."
